# Architecture, Decisions, Changelogs, and Issue Tracking Framework Plan

## Goal Description
Establish a single source of truth for capturing all architecture discussions, technical decisions, feature proposals (RFCs), bug reports/incident post-mortems, improvement proposals, and changelogs directly inside this Turborepo repository (`api-gateway-fullstack`).

The system is designed to work seamlessly whether decisions and changes are initiated by **you (the developer)** or generated by **AI coding agents** (Antigravity, Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot).

---

