## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Changelog Mechanism**: We propose using **Changesets** (`@changesets/cli`), which is the industry standard for Turborepo and pnpm monorepos. It allows both humans and AI to create small markdown changeset files (`.changeset/<name>.md`) for every change, which automatically roll up into package `CHANGELOG.md` files upon versioning.

> [!NOTE]
> **Storage Location**: Documentation will live under the root `docs/` folder in plain Markdown. This ensures:
> 1. Fast indexing and low token overhead for AI agents.
> 2. Zero-dependency version control tracking with clear Git diffs.
> 3. Future compatibility with `apps/docs` (can import or render from `docs/` if a web UI is desired).

