### 6. AI Agent Guidelines & Automatic Enforcement

#### [NEW] [.agents/rules/decisions-and-docs.md](file:///home/prakul/Documents/Coding/2026%20Coding/api-gateway-fullstack/.agents/rules/decisions-and-docs.md)
Living agent rule file that instructs any AI agent working on this repo:
1. **Before proposing changes**: Check `docs/adr/` and `docs/rfc/` for existing architectural decisions.
2. **When making architectural choices**: Propose and draft a new ADR in `docs/adr/` using the template.
3. **When implementing features or fixing bugs**: Add a changeset (`.changeset/*.md`) or bug RCA (`docs/bugs/`).
4. **Never silently change architecture**: Explicitly link decisions to the corresponding ADR.

